  "title": "Consolidate the locomotion kernel and remove stale context",
  "summary": "We consolidate canonical simulation, stock PPO, load tracking, evaluation and guarded execution under locomotion/. We remove the custom learner, source-rewriting launcher and unused packaged RS05 port. We retire 45 stale Markdown files into verified Git history, shorten the main guides and reduce current findings from 89 to seven. The cleanup removes 8,095 Python lines and 13,508 Markdown lines net. All 1,244 tests pass. Native standing passes at one and 128 robots. A two-update PPO checkpoint reloads in a separate native evaluation; the three probes record force and torque, with a 500-frame policy video. Forward walking fails; quiet and stop checks pass. We preserve the original numerical gates and Stage 2 remains incomplete.",
